{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47216","headline":"中秋旅怀 · 尚能","name":"中秋旅怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"所畜惟骚雅，兼之得固穷。\n望乡连北斗，听雨带西风。\n稼穑村坊远，烟波路迳通。\n冥搜清绝句，恰似有神功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"尚能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47216.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47216","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}